    },
    {
      "effect": "Used on a party Pokémon\n:   Evolves an Alola Sandshrew into Alola Sandslash or an Alola Vulpix into Alola Ninetales.",
      "short_effect": "Evolves an Alola Sandshrew into Alola Sandslash or an Alola Vulpix into Alola Ninetales.",
      "language": {
