      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ある　とくていの　ポケモンを\nしんかさせる　ふしぎな　いし。\nゆきの　もようが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어느 특정 포켓몬을\n진화시키는 이상한 돌.\n눈송이 무늬가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓特定寶可夢\n進化的神奇石頭。\n有著雪花般的花紋。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pierre étrange qui fait évoluer certaines\nespèces de Pokémon. Un flocon de neige\nsemble dessiné dessus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieser spezielle Stein löst bei bestimmten\nPokémon die Entwicklung aus. Er hat ein\nSchneeflockenmuster.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una piedra peculiar que hace evolucionar a algunos\nPokémon. Presenta motivos que recuerdan a los\ncristales de hielo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pietra particolare che fa evolvere determinate\nspecie di Pokémon. Si intravede l’immagine di\nun fiocco di neve.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar stone that can make certain species of\nPokémon evolve. It has an unmistakable\nsnowflake pattern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
